{"ticker":"GE","updated":"2026-11-20T22:56:37Z","profile":{"longName":"GE Aerospace","shortName":"GE Aerospace","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"United States","website":"https://www.geaerospace.com","fullTimeEmployees":57000,"marketCap":319946424320,"trailingPE":35.385143,"forwardPE":33.24675,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.085408,"pegRatio":3.84,"targetMeanPrice":378.42856,"targetHighPrice":431.0,"targetLowPrice":280.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.159,"earningsGrowth":0.089,"grossMargins":0.30065,"operatingMargins":0.19681999,"profitMargins":0.17313999,"totalRevenue":52576002048,"beta":1.409,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":388.84,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":268.91,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.59},"summary":"General Electric Company, doing business as GE Aerospace, designs and produces commercial and defense aircraft engines, integrated engine components, electric power, and aircraft systems. The company operates through two segments, Commercial Engines & Services, and Defense & Propulsion Technologies. The Commercial Engines & Services segment designs, develops, manufactures, maintenance, repair, and overhaul (MRO) services of jet engines and sale of spare parts for commercial airframes, business aviation, and aeroderivative applications. The Defense & Propulsion Technologies designs, develops, manufactures, and services jet engines and avionics and power systems for governments, militaries, and commercial airframers, as well as MRO of engines and the sale of spare parts. This segment also offers aircraft components and systems, such as small turboprop engines, aeroengine mechanical transmissions, turbines, combustors and controls, additive manufacturing, propeller systems, ignition systems, sensors and engine accessories for fixed wing and rotorcraft applications for commercial and military end users under the Avio Aero, Unison, Dowty Propellers, and Colibrium Additive brands. The company operates in the United States, Europe, Asia, the Americas, the Middle East, and Africa. General Electric Company was incorporated in 1892 and is based in Evendale, Ohio.","summary_zh":"通用電氣公司（通用電氣航空航太公司）設計和生產商用和國防飛機發動機、整合式發動機零件、電力和飛機系統。該公司透過兩個部門運作：商用引擎和服務部門以及國防和推進技術部門。商用發動機和服務部門提供噴射發動機的設計、開發、製造、維護、修理和大修 (MRO) 服務，以及銷售商用機身、公務航空和航改應用的備件。國防與推進技術公司為政府、軍事和商用飛機製造商設計、開發、製造噴射發動機、航空電子設備和電力系統並提供服務，以及發動機的 MRO 和備件銷售。該部門還以 Avio Aero、Unison、Dowty Propellers 和 Colibrium Additive 品牌為商業和軍事最終用戶提供飛機零件和系統，例如小型渦輪螺旋槳發動機、航空發動機機械傳動裝置、渦輪機、燃燒器和控制裝置、增材製造、螺旋槳系統、點火系統、感測器和固定翼和旋翼飛機應用的發動機和旋翼飛機應用的引擎。該公司在美國、歐洲、亞洲、美洲、中東和非洲開展業務。通用電氣公司成立於 1892 年，總部位於俄亥俄州埃文代爾。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"航空航太與國防","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":300.1,"h":301.15,"l":296.35,"c":301.02,"v":4192800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":301.65,"h":305.77,"l":301.15,"c":305.63,"v":3637400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":306.9,"h":307.25,"l":298.79,"c":300.3,"v":5645500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":298.5,"h":300.24,"l":294.87,"c":297.18,"v":4504500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":299.93,"h":302.0,"l":292.75,"c":294.98,"v":3817600},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":296.36,"h":297.93,"l":289.66,"c":293.63,"v":3860800},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":294.71,"h":301.47,"l":293.91,"c":300.82,"v":4112400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":296.38,"h":302.23,"l":295.03,"c":300.88,"v":3633300},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":302.31,"h":303.44,"l":296.8,"c":299.45,"v":2508200},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":299.46,"h":302.75,"l":295.46,"c":297.0,"v":2817000},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":295.8,"h":299.29,"l":294.75,"c":298.22,"v":2759800},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":298.07,"h":302.74,"l":297.89,"c":301.74,"v":2578800},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":303.4,"h":304.67,"l":299.59,"c":302.56,"v":2658600},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":302.71,"h":304.0,"l":296.1,"c":299.35,"v":4292500},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":299.0,"h":300.0,"l":291.49,"c":291.49,"v":3380000},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":296.0,"h":297.58,"l":293.12,"c":297.53,"v":2604100},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":294.84,"h":302.29,"l":292.01,"c":300.08,"v":2516500},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":301.54,"h